msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ooh, scary.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫C’mon now, what happened to you, little Jack?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫"
"Where’d the little boy who used to call me Uncle Tommy go?"
